hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"222","Wa qāla ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam: \Inna lillāhi malā'ikatan sayyāḥīna fī al-arḍi yuballighūnī min ummatī al-salām.\"". And he (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \""Indeed"","" Allah has angels who travel throughout the earth and convey to me the greetings of peace from my Ummah (community).\"""
"223","Wa qāla ṣallā Allāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam: \Mā min aḥadin yusallimu ʿalayya illā radda Allāhu ʿalayya rūḥī ḥattā arūda ʿalayhi al-salām.\"". And he (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \""There is no one who sends blessings upon me except that Allah returns my soul to me so that I may return the greeting of peace to him.\"""
